#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:185
msgid "``compress()`` rejects out-of-range quality *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``compress()`` 拒絕超出範圍的品質值 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:187
msgid ""
"``image.compress()`` / ``compressed()`` now raise an error when ``quality`` "
"is outside 1–100 instead of silently clamping. Clamp ``quality`` into 1–100 "
"before calling. Separately, the OpenMV 3 JPEG buffer was reduced from 64 KB "
"to 23000 bytes, so large frames may now raise out-of-memory — lower the JPEG"
" quality or framesize."
msgstr ""
"當 ``quality`` 超出 1–100 範圍時，\\ ``image.compress()`` ／ ``compressed()`` "
"現在會拋出錯誤，而非默默地夾限。請在呼叫前將 ``quality`` 夾限至 1–100。另外，OpenMV 3 的 JPEG 緩衝區已從 64 KB "
"縮減為 23000 位元組，因此大型影格現在可能會引發記憶體不足——請降低 JPEG 品質或影格大小。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.1.0.rst:193
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `9efd7474a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9efd7474a>`__, `9a7c3defc "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9a7c3defc>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `9efd7474a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/9efd7474a>`__, `9a7c3defc "
